BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//eunomia//routine example//EN
X-WR-CALNAME:routine
COMMENT:Eunomia routine — the ideal recurring day. Put these VEVENTs in the
 RustiCal calendar named by EUNOMIA_CALDAV_ROUTINE (default "routine") and edit
 them from any calendar app. Recurrence is owned by the calendar: an occurrence
 exists for Eunomia iff the calendar produces one. Checklist steps ride in the
 DESCRIPTION as lines starting "- " or "* "; each becomes its own to-do, tagged
 with the block name. A block without steps becomes a single to-do.
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:morning-routine@eunomia.example
SUMMARY:Morning Routine
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Madrid:20260101T073000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Madrid:20260101T075000
RRULE:FREQ=DAILY
DESCRIPTION:- brush teeth\n- shower
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lunch@eunomia.example
SUMMARY:Lunch
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Madrid:20260101T130000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Madrid:20260101T134500
RRULE:FREQ=DAILY
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:workout@eunomia.example
SUMMARY:Workout
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Madrid:20260105T180000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Madrid:20260105T190000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=MO,WE,FR
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
